schema: "0.4"
id: echo-of-manifestation-env-the-threshold
type: image
quality: medium

prompt:
  text: >
    Dark fantasy concept art of the Threshold — Zone 8 of the Twilight Zone, the final zone
    before the Grand Manifestation. This environment is rendered in STRICTLY black and white
    — no amber, no indigo, no color whatsoever. The boundary between worlds is dissolving
    here — the material world and the Plane of Echoes have merged into a single space where
    distinction between the two is meaningless. The landscape is an infinite flat expanse of
    white ground beneath a black sky, or perhaps black ground beneath a white sky — the
    orientation shifts depending on where you look. The only definite feature is a single
    figure-sized point of warm light at the center of the composition — representing the
    player character as the sole remaining light source in a world that has given up color.
    Shadows here move independently of any object — they crawl across the ground, pool into
    shapes, rise into three-dimensional forms, and dissolve again, completely untethered
    from the objects that should cast them. The Threshold itself is suggested by a vast
    horizontal line that bisects the scene — the exact point where one world ends and another
    begins, though both are now identical void. Architectural fragments float in the air:
    a doorframe with no wall, a staircase to nowhere, a window frame containing only void.
    The mood is the death of distinction — a place where categories like light/dark,
    real/echo, being/nonbeing have lost all meaning. Painterly style with stark contrast.
  negative: "bright, cheerful, cartoon, anime, clean magic, any color except black white gray, warm tones, amber, indigo, colorful palette, detailed environment, recognizable architecture, low detail, flat shading"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1536
    height: 1024
    aspect_ratio: "3:2"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.7
  criteria:
    atmosphere: {weight: 3, description: "Mood matches prompt — dark, corrupted, liminal space feeling"}
    composition: {weight: 2, description: "Depth and spatial structure readable, foreground-midground-background layers"}
    prompt_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Key architectural/environmental details from prompt present"}
    style_consistency: {weight: 2, description: "Dark fantasy painterly style, chiaroscuro lighting, indigo-amber palette"}
  reject_if:
    - "bright sunlight or cheerful atmosphere"
    - "modern or clean architecture"
    - "cartoon or anime style"

tags: [environment, zone-8, threshold, final-zone, black-and-white, concept-art, dark-fantasy, void]
